    "turn_text": "There's an efficient way to get caught up on a lot of news. It's called The Seven from The Washington Post. It's a newsletter and podcast. Whether you're reading or hit play, you get seven stories you need to know and you can consume it all in just a few minutes. The Seven is out every weekday morning by 7 a.m. Eastern. I'm Hannah Jewell. I'm one of the writers and I host the show. Find The Seven Podcast Wherever You're Listening. The newsletter link is waiting for you in the show notes.",
