        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Internal party conflicts over leadership are ultimately beneficial when they result in policy action.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker of the House has significant influence over legislative priorities and agenda-setting.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "My past campaign against Mitch McConnell demonstrates credibility and commitment to reforming Republican leadership.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Public trust in political institutions is contingent upon visible policy achievements aligned with constituent concerns.",
