  },
  {
    "episode_id": 96797,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/6/96797.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 15,
    "turn_text": "You know, so I was gonna ask you about that a moment from now, but let's go there. You know, you already said you're a business guy, which we of course all know. You know, if you take a step back and you look at the process of what everybody endured last week going into, I guess late Friday night, early Saturday morning, do you look at this and say this was a colossal waste of time or this is an exciting part of the process to figure out who should lead a party at certain levels?",
