  {
    "episode_id": 96797,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/6/96797.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 16,
    "turn_text": "I think it's part of the process. think about this way, the leader simply reflects the views of the members, right? So if you represent South Florida, okay, you don't work for somebody that says, oh, I don't care about South Florida. So, so like what I when I ran against McConnell, I said, I respect that everybody represents their state. So let's fight over what's good for the whole country rather than let's give all this power to one person and then they get to make the decision about what they think is good for your state or your district. So I think what happened last week with Kevin McCarthy and I've got a very good working relationship with Kevin McCarthy. I think it was very positive. We're going to start doing things that people care about around the country. We're going to have votes. over the debt ceiling. We're going to talk about how we're going to stop this increased debt all the time. We're going to talk about how we balance the budget. We're going to talk about passing budgets. I mean, we don't even pass a budget. The last omnibus bill, it was three times the size of buyable. We got it at 1.30 in the morning, Tuesday morning. We're expecting voted on on Wednesday. So this is wrong. This is not the way our government should work. So I'm excited about what's going on.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_03",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
    "explicit_propositions": [
      {
        "text": "The leader reflects the views of the members.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The last omnibus bill exceeded its intended scope by threefold.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Representatives should prioritize their constituents' interests over external directives.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The previous omnibus bill was approved at 1:30 AM on Tuesday and voted on Wednesday.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Political competition should focus on national benefit rather than centralized power.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Kevin McCarthy's leadership post-last-week event was positive.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "There will be upcoming votes on the debt ceiling.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Discussions about reducing federal debt will take place.",
