  {
    "episode_id": 96797,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/6/96797.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 19,
    "turn_text": "And I'm not trying to, I'm really not trying to put you on the spot here, but kidding aside, do you ever look at, I mean, you lived through the experience of living in Tallahassee, of running this state. Do you ever look at some of the controversy that does seem to follow Governor DeSantis and say, you know, perhaps there's a little too much noise and, you know, some of the good things he's, you know, he does are very easily shot down because there's so much other noise. I mean, you've lived there. What's, what's it like inside the bubble?",
